# The processor's VCCIO2 (eMMC / FSPI) IO supply.  Split out of 21_emmc.net on 2026-11-21, when the eMMC left the
# mainboard: the domain stays powered on both boards; commander_cpu_ram shares this file and 21_emmc.shared.
#
# --- U1I VCCIO2 (eMMC/FSPI) domain: unpopulated on the 3E; Commander adds eMMC ---
SHEET soc_usb
P U1 1C13=VCCIO_FLASH
C42 100nF VCCIO_FLASH GND
R68 DNP VCC_3V3 VCCIO_FLASH
R69 0R VCC_1V8 VCCIO_FLASH
C140 4.7uF VCCIO_FLASH GND
